  "details": "Basically the ability to override the post-processing effects or shader effects in a world we join or players we see, I noticed that almost every world has different shaders and some users also use different shaders.\nIt would allow those of us with beefier setups (not me) to have a better visual experience and also allow those who have a bad setup (me) to disable specific options and have a higher fps.\nAlso some worlds have colour grading which cannot disabled and it is really annoying.",
